``` Detection: Mass file download / potential exfiltration (T1567)
    Data: O365 / cloud audit (FileDownloaded, FileSyncDownloaded).
    Logic: a user downloading an anomalous volume of files/bytes in one hour. ```

index=o365 sourcetype="o365:management:activity"
    Operation IN ("FileDownloaded","FileSyncDownloadedFull")
| bucket _time span=1h
| stats count as downloads
        sum(eval(coalesce(ObjectSize,0))) as total_bytes
        dc(SourceFileName) as distinct_files
        by UserId, _time
| eval total_MB = round(total_bytes/1024/1024, 1)
| where downloads > 100 OR total_MB > 500
| sort - downloads

``` Enrich with the user's 30-day baseline; alert on deviation, not a fixed number.
    On true positive: disable sessions, revoke tokens, engage DLP/legal, run IR playbook. ```
